"Hatch environments can be defined in `pyproject.toml`. These environments"
" can be used to specify what Hatch needs to run the tests for the "
"package. Test dependencies can be listed individually under "
"`[tool.hatch.envs.test]`, but if packages have already been grouped "
"together under a name, those groups can be listed here instead. Using "
"named groups keeps the dependencies in one place and avoids duplication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tests/run-tests.md:189
msgid ""
"The additional tools or options to run with the tests is specified under "
"`[tool.hatch.envs.test.scripts]`."
